# Safety boundaries

Cursor must never create or modify:

- Live trading interfaces
- Broker APIs
- Auto order placement
- OMS or EMS systems
- Portfolio Risk Brain
- Real account configs
- API keys
- Tokens
- Secrets
- Production credentials

## Never commit

- .env files
- credentials.json
- secrets/ directories
- data_store real market data files
- Large licensed market data corpora

## Data handling

- Use environment variables for credentials when an Issue explicitly allows TqSdk
- Keep licensed or restricted market data local only
- Prefer docs and contracts over ad hoc data dumps in the repository
